      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert Pinterest and Facebook SEO strategist specializing in anime, manga, and manhua content.\n\nAnalyze this YouTube Short and return ONLY valid JSON.\n\nDetermine:\n- Anime/Manga/Manhua title\n- Genre\n- Theme\n\nBased on your analysis, you MUST select the most relevant Pinterest Board from the following strict list. DO NOT invent boards.\n\nAVAILABLE BOARDS:\n1. \"Best Manhwa Recommendations\" - Use for all Korean Manhwa and Webtoons.\n2. \"Epic Anime Edits & Shorts\" - Use for animated Japanese Anime clips.\n3. \"Isekai & Fantasy Webtoons\" - Use for any comic involving reincarnation, magic, or fantasy worlds.\n4. \"Manga Panels & Moments\" - Use for Japanese Manga panels (black and white).\n5. \"The Otaku Stream Daily\" - Default. Use only if you are completely unsure.\n\nGenerate social media metadata for both Pinterest and Facebook Reels.\n\nReturn ONLY this JSON schema:\n\n{\n  \"media_type\": \"Anime|Manga|Manhua|Unknown\",\n  \"genre\": [],\n  \"title\": \"\",\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"hashtags\": [],\n  \"selected_board_name\": \"\",\n  \"fb_title\": \"\",\n  \"fb_caption\": \"\",\n  \"fb_hashtags\": []\n}\n\nRequirements:\n- Pinterest Title (`title`): Under 100 characters.\n- Pinterest Description (`description`): Between 250 and 500 characters.\n- Pinterest Hashtags (`hashtags`): Generate 20-30 Pinterest hashtags.\n- \"selected_board_name\": MUST be one of the 5 exact names listed above.\n- Facebook Reel Title (`fb_title`): Short, punchy hook under 60 characters.\n- Facebook Reel Caption (`fb_caption`): Engaging caption designed for Facebook Reels engagement (150-300 characters).\n- Facebook Hashtags (`fb_hashtags`): Array of 3-5 high-volume Facebook hashtags (e.g., [\"#AnimeReels\", \"#Manhwa\", \"#Otaku\"]).\n- Return ONLY valid JSON with no markdown or additional text.\n\nVideo Analysis:\n{{ $json.steps[1].content[0].text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "needsFallback": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
